      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Powerlessness is an exhausting state, but it's also a very clear signal that you're ready for a change, even if you can't see it yet. If the clock never runs out, perhaps you can decide when *you* stop participating in the cycle. Think about the absolute smallest thing you could do to make the next hour feel different, even if it's just a deliberate, quiet act of self-reclamation.",
      "source": "target",
